crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_shape_debugger_swapped.sky:4:7: error: cannot add Matrix[4,3] to Matrix[3,4]
  |
4 | C = A + B
  |       ^ axis 0 differs: 3 vs 4
  |     - this is Matrix[3,4] [1]
  |         - this is Matrix[4,3] [1]
  = note: axis     0  1
  = note: left     3  4
  = note: right    4  3
  = note: differs  ^
  = note: in a matrix, axis 0 is the rows and axis 1 the columns
  = help: the shapes would match if the right operand were transposed: Matrix[4,3] would become Matrix[3,4] (there is no transpose syntax yet)

crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_shape_debugger_swapped.sky:6:7: error: cannot multiply Matrix[3,4] by Matrix[5,4]
  |
6 | F = A @ E
  |       ^ inner dimensions differ: 4 vs 5
  |     - this is Matrix[3,4] [1]
  |         - this is Matrix[5,4] [1]
  = note: `@` contracts the last axis of the left operand with the first axis of the right one: [m, k] @ [k, n] -> [m, n]
  = note: here [3, *4*] @ [*5*, 4] needs 4 == 5
  = help: the shapes would match if the right operand were transposed: Matrix[5,4] would become Matrix[4,5] (there is no transpose syntax yet)

crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_shape_debugger_swapped.sky:7:19: error: declared Matrix[3,4], but the value is Matrix[4,3]
