  |    ------------ expected because of this annotation
  = note: axis      0  1
  = note: declared  3  4
  = note: value     4  3
  = note: differs   ^
  = note: in a matrix, axis 0 is the rows and axis 1 the columns
  = help: the shapes would match if the value were transposed: Matrix[4,3] would become Matrix[3,4] (there is no transpose syntax yet)

crates/sky-types/tests/ui/err_shape_debugger_swapped.sky:9:7: error: cannot add a vector to a matrix
